- Wrong worker.
- Wrong installation.
- Duplicate worker identity.
- Reused public key.
- Reused browser profile.
- Expired enrollment.
- Revoked identity.
- Replayed challenge.
- Concurrent pairing.
- Device key rotation.
- Lost device.
- Corrupted device state.
- Missing or stale Admin authorization.

